  "description": "One ci-observe capture, minute by minute: how many pods existed, what each pod used in CPU and memory, what the node used, and which pods existed when. Pick a capture in the Run box and set the time range to cover it: the collector samples every 60 seconds and Prometheus keeps 15 days.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Run Investigation",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ci-observe-runs/ci-observe-e28094-run-investigation?var-capture_id=${capture_id}"
    },
    {
      "title": "Run evidence",
